      "decorators": [
        "router.post('/reddit-search')"
      ],
      "purpose": "Search Reddit's public JSON for intent phrases across channels (runs on the\nweb process \u2014 worker IPs are blocked). Returns normalized posts. Reddit\nrequires a descriptive User-Agent and rate-limits, so this is polite.\nBody: {channels: [str], queries: [str], limit: int}. Returns {posts: [...]}."
    },
